수), 토·일요일]</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; ○ 방학 중 사회봉사1,2 인정기간 : 2014. 12. 23.(화) ~ 2015. 2. 13.(금)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; ○ 사회봉사확인서 제출기간 : 2015. 2. 12.(목) ~ 2. 13.(금)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ⇒ 사회봉사 과목은 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">2015년 2월 졸업예정자</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">의 경우 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">졸업 학점으로 인정되지 않으니</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 수강신청에 반드시 유의바랍니다. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" clas