mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">2014. 11. 24.(월) 10:00 ~ 11. 27.(목) 18:00, 4일간</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[원스톱서비스 - 학사관리 - 수강신청 - (계절)수강신청 입력] </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">6. 수강료 : 25,000원/학점당</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;- 2학점 강좌 : 50,000원 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;- 3학점 강좌 : 75,000원</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">7. 수강료 납부 :</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 2014. 12. 2.(화) ~ 12. 5.(금) [4일간], </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">농협(가상계좌 납부 가능)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글